MD simulation of a spring-mass chain with Langevin thermostat.

```gnuplot
set title 'Langevin thermalization'
set xlabel 't [ps]'
set ylabel 'T [K]'
set key bottom right

a = 10.0
b = 20.0
c = 10.0
d = 10.0
e = 20.0
f = 10.0
f(x)=a*log(b*x+c)
g(x)=d*log(e*x+f)
fit [0:70] f(x) 'out1.dat' u 1:6 via a,b,c
fit [0:70] g(x) 'out2.dat' u 1:6 via d,e,f

p 'out1.dat' u 1:6 w l lw 2 t 'T_{m},gamma=1.0' , 'out2.dat' u 1:6 w l lw 2 t 'T_{m},gamma=0.1',100 w l lw 2 t 'T_{thermostat}', f(x) w l lw 2 t 'Fit: ' , g(x) w l lw 2 t 'Fit: 23 ln(0.5 t + 4.5)'

```
